# answer away); the after-show list in the private folder removes these lines
episode-2/examples/04-run-on-screen.txt
episode-2/examples/05-ruling.md
episode-2/examples/06-ruling-declined-ban-and-prediction.md
episode-2/examples/07-the-entry-as-written.json
dictionary/*.json
